+# Real native and spatial qualification
+
+Prepare only until ROOT commits the frozen normalizer and separately approves
+this exact protocol/test/capture. No source query has been authorized to run yet.
+Only this new evidence namespace may change. The old89-query/254796352B ledger,
+old tests/proofs, normalizer, model, sealed migrations and CI remain read only.
+
+One explicit mixed-origin capture: AWS indexed index plus two pinned normalized
+Ligue1partitions; Neon exact existing m_0xOQtL/home_ltr resource and its existing
+object. The Neon choice is declared before capture; no AWS-miss fallback or
+supplier-freshness inference. Bodies live only in process RAM and same-user
+private Unix IPC. Typed local PostgreSQL is the sole business output.
+
+The independent E2E is written before capture/import. It confirms all31 native
+metric slots, exact common projections and binding/version/unit metadata, then
+ordered sparse cells, explicit dimensions/frame, actor/side/cohort and complete
+source-record locators. It starts an empty owned PG18.6 candidate under the
+actual ingest role. No demonstration correction, synthetic sports observation
+or unrelated fixture is inserted. Reimport in a fresh process consumes the
+same RAM snapshot, with all tables/sequences unchanged.
+
